VALUES ('2096a558-0aac-4139-ad08-7ee022ea4d52', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000400', 'The US used the term Domino Theory to describe growing concern over communist influence in Indochina. This theory was quite clear: if the communists were not stopped, then they will expand to neighbouring countries. The French forces were defeated by the Viet Minh at the Battle of Dien Bien Phu, on 7 May 1954. In peace negotiations at Geneva, (the Geneva Accords May 1954) the decision was reached to divide Vietnam into northern and southern halves. Laos and Cambodia were made independent. The North and South Vietnam were separated at the 17 th parallel. History Grade 10 Student Textbook', 'G10-History-STB-2023-web.pdf p.1', '2026.1', 'published', '[0.04084462,-0.003073366,-0.013762844,-0.040495407,0.019444106,-0.00868307,0.006404419,0.024421467,-0.0052303853,-0.10849509,-0.01944278,-0.022146177,0.024387557,0.03647417,-0.04279265,-0.040137064,0.015284875,0.008418908,0.04442935,0.018069448,0.012604424,-0.02080797,0.002668774,-0.018443203,-0.004586085,0.00023056242,0.0029286665,-0.039056852,-0.037225902,0.1854116,-0.02331256,-0.030035762,-0.019543169,0.015886249,0.017932,0.011319485,-0.024383603,-0.044876806,0.041799527,0.05124732,0.0016110119,-0.02025881,-0.0017413085,-0.012231021,-0.016962325,-0.008936102,-0.04303145,0.031196903,0.004777269,0.031269103,-0.018235717,0.0059693055,0.01755029,-0.017625192,-0.00046959697,0.05153196,-0.022381604,-0.023027383,0.020899605,0.023068843,-0.036576513,0.006545401,-0.0058512404,-0.017830757,-0.037238304,0.0019310355,-0.013465653,-0.067836694,0.0036435914,-0.027964748,0.040623583,0.018075993,0.042396285,-0.02477605,-0.06780805,0.012205431,-0.0011388805,-0.03138349,0.0056992695,0.0027126689,0.003160149,0.055616826,0.0066841394,-0.026285632,0.02197922,-0.025221394,-0.006361792,0.023626417,0.03368776,0.049255796,0.015644722,-0.006399789,0.015075925,-0.0059915627,-0.034310825,-0.071105,0.010856746,-0.037317898,-0.01927693,-0.019435417,-0.026400361,